WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:07.140
60 YEARS AGO THIS OCTOBER, "WEST
SIDE STORY" WAS RELEASED.

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:11.870
IT WOULD GO ON TO WIN
TEN COMPETITIVE OSCARS,

00:00:11.870 --> 00:00:16.898
MOST FAMOUSLY FOR
BEST SUPPORTING ACTRESS.

00:00:16.898 --> 00:00:24.510
[ CHEERS AND APPLAUSE ]

00:00:24.510 --> 00:00:29.279
AMONG ITS OTHER SMALLER AWARDS
WAS BEST PICTURE OF THE YEAR,

00:00:29.279 --> 00:00:33.930
AND THAT IS WHAT I AM
HERE TO PRESENT.

00:00:35.955 --> 00:00:38.129
“THE FATHER” DAVID PARFITT,

00:00:38.129 --> 00:00:42.644
JEAN-LOUIS LIVI, AND PHILLIPE
CARCASSONNE, PRODUCERS.

00:00:42.644 --> 00:00:45.610
"JUDAS AND THE BLACK
MESSIAH” SHAKA KING,

00:00:45.610 --> 00:00:49.020
CHARLES D. KING, AND
RYAN COOGLER, PRODUCERS.

00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:52.490
“MANK” CEAN CHAFFIN,
ERIC ROTH, AND DOUGLAS

00:00:52.490 --> 00:00:54.370
URBANKSI, PRODUCERS.

00:00:54.370 --> 00:00:57.542
“MINARI” CHRISTINA OH,
PRODUCER.

00:00:57.542 --> 00:01:01.110
“NOMADLAND” FRANCES
MCDORMAND, PETER SPEARS,

00:01:01.110 --> 00:01:05.710
MOLLYE ASHER, DAN JANVEY,
AND CHLOE ZHAO, PRODUCERS.

00:01:05.710 --> 00:01:07.470
“PROMISING YOUNG WOMAN”

00:01:07.470 --> 00:01:10.530
BEN BROWNING, ASHLEY FOX,
EMERALD FENNELL, AND

00:01:10.530 --> 00:01:12.634
JOSEY MCNAMARA,
PRODUCERS.

00:01:12.887 --> 00:01:15.740
“SOUND OF METAL”
BERT HAMELINCK AND

00:01:15.740 --> 00:01:18.282
SACHA BEN HARROCHE, PRODUCERS.

00:01:18.629 --> 00:01:20.440
“THE TRIAL OF THE CHICAGO 7"

00:01:20.440 --> 00:01:23.351
MARC PLATT AND
STUART BESSER, PRODUCERS.

00:01:28.212 --> 00:01:31.160
AND THE OSCAR GOES TO --

00:01:32.672 --> 00:01:33.822
“NOMADLAND”

00:01:33.822 --> 00:01:38.468
[ CHEERS AND APPLAUSE ]

00:02:20.400 --> 00:02:24.610
ON BEHALF OF MY FELLOW
PRODUCERS, PETER SPEARS,

00:02:24.610 --> 00:02:27.970
MOLLYE ASHER, DAN JANVEY,
AND THE ONE AND ONLY

00:02:27.970 --> 00:02:32.500
FRANCES MCDORMAND,
WE THANK THE ACADEMY

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:36.280
AND WE THANK OUR BRILLIANT
FELLOW NOMINEES AND

00:02:36.280 --> 00:02:38.780
WE THANK ALL THE HEARTS
AND HANDS THAT COME TOGETHER

00:02:38.780 --> 00:02:39.959
TO MAKE THIS MOVIE.

00:02:39.959 --> 00:02:42.440
FROM SEARCHLIGHT PICTURES.

00:02:42.440 --> 00:02:45.830
JESSICA BRUDER, WHO TRUSTED
US WITH HER BEAUTIFUL BOOK.

00:02:45.830 --> 00:02:49.650
TO OUR BRILLIANT CINEMATOGRAPHER
JOSHUA JAMES RICHARDS.

00:02:49.650 --> 00:02:53.030
AND TO THE ENTIRE
“NOMADLAND” COMPANY.

00:02:53.030 --> 00:02:57.090
WE WANT TO SHOW OUR
DEEPEST GRATITUDE TO LINDA MAY,

00:02:57.090 --> 00:03:01.050
SWANKIE, BOB WELLS,
AND NOMADIC COMMUNITY,

00:03:01.050 --> 00:03:03.300
ALL THE PEOPLE WE MET ON
THE ROAD.

00:03:03.300 --> 00:03:04.300
THANK YOU FOR TEACHING

00:03:04.300 --> 00:03:08.110
US THE POWER OF RESILIENCE AND
HOPE, AND FOR REMINDING US

00:03:08.110 --> 00:03:10.470
WHAT TRUE KINDNESS LOOKS LIKE.

00:03:10.470 --> 00:03:12.970
AND NOW I GIVE YOU FERN.

00:03:16.267 --> 00:03:17.626
&gt;&gt; NO, I’M NOT.

00:03:17.626 --> 00:03:19.629
I’M FRAN.

00:03:19.629 --> 00:03:21.989
PLEASE WATCH
OUR MOVIE ON THE LARGEST

00:03:21.989 --> 00:03:26.680
SCREEN POSSIBLE AND ONE DAY
VERY, VERY SOON, TAKE EVERYONE

00:03:26.680 --> 00:03:33.030
YOU KNOW INTO A THEATER, SHOULDER
TO SHOULDER IN THAT DARK SPACE

00:03:33.030 --> 00:03:37.440
AND WATCH EVERY FILM THAT’S
REPRESENTED HERE TONIGHT.

00:03:37.440 --> 00:03:40.210
WE GIVE THIS ONE TO OUR WOLF

00:03:40.210 --> 00:03:45.267
[HOWLS]

